{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c07d25384c90d527b4fce8013030607002df362e2d99419c9409f5d8535bd35f", "ja": "（劇場のアイドルが総出演する大型バラエティ番組が\n終わった。みんな、本当によく頑張ってくれたな！）", "zh": "（剧场的偶像们全员出演的大型综艺节目结束了。大家真的都辛苦了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "c035623bfea16bed35458addc7584d25dde9d0eeda4ad7004a8d675a797ff39d", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n生放送、無事に終わってホッとしました。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n直播顺利结束，我总算松了口气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1002_p", "source_sha256": "84e1ce9b18ca67df3befc3c588d0dc2820db404ba4f44e883ff51f7f760e96f1", "ja": "これもみんなの協力のおかげだよ。\n瑞希も長時間の司会、本当にお疲れさま。", "zh": "这也多亏了大家的协助。\n瑞希，长时间主持辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "e18e29ce577c269ac9b3fd989ea619b57985d0ba6cf20211ca51f51e5f771f1a", "ja": "はい、やり遂げました。\n今までの人生で、一番しゃべった気がします。", "zh": "是，我完成了。\n感觉这是我人生中说话最多的一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "c05db0374f6725759f702ade6c98a2af2d4118385f8f517f2692da4579113e59", "ja": "おかげでトークに自信がつきました。今なら、\nトークショーもいけそうです……ペラペラペラ。", "zh": "多亏了您，我对聊天有信心了。现在的话，说不定连脱口秀都能应付……滔滔不绝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f93f54542eb2585e2264e94c5eb43c195cffab553d86faadb76cf7cc443acdf7", "ja": "考えてみると、瑞希は司会向きかもしれないな。\n今回だって、見事な司会ぶりだったし。", "zh": "这么一想，瑞希说不定很适合当主持人呢。\n这次她的主持也表现得很出色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "c73af61d3b7d29fdab668a401c8b10d172ad645d5c52ab4814f07ec707d5f900", "ja": "なんと。褒めて頂けるのは、嬉しいですが……。\n今回、上手くいったのは、みなさんのおかげです。", "zh": "哎呀。能得到您的夸奖，我很高兴，但是……\n\n这次能顺利进行，都是多亏了大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "71a1df8d305a966335983b1c50b884b185313de2fa522b64780f073206927c1f", "ja": "中でも貴音さんには、お世話になってしまいました。\n私の笑顔が、期待されていたとは……目から鱗だぞ。", "zh": "尤其是贵音小姐，我真的受了她很多照顾。没想到大家竟然期待着我的笑容……真是让我大开眼界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "3fb92bedb9cf94349b9a186be82e3d2511fde87cf56cef14848e09d9e38aa918", "ja": "{$P$}、あの後、\n私はちゃんと、笑顔になれていましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，那之后，我有好好露出笑容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e5d80dc86287d1be4e738c0e6a083b2601e62bf5033a012bdd38f21df9209776", "ja": "ああ、凄くいい笑顔だったと思うよ。\nお客さんもみんな、元気になれたと思う。", "zh": "啊，我觉得那是非常棒的笑容。\n我想客人们也都精神起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "73fe4f0d2dea91f319deb11d50ff7773dca6439cb71e52a3b426b14a8d9f2bf5", "ja": "そうですか、良かったです。\n……えへへ。", "zh": "是吗，那太好了。\n……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8813e8430c0bbdb14e02c31f979e3f0cbd91a00818e51985219bab72a7ef8c9", "ja": "{$P$}。\n私を司会に選んでくれて、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n谢谢您选我担任主持人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "6d4c290a827819f7578bcc24938e5c3d477e27ac174093814f805a1f1b64ddf2", "ja": "おかげで、たくさん成長できた気がしましゅ……。\nいいところで噛みました。トークショーは、時期尚早。", "zh": "多亏了您，我感觉自己成长了许多……  \n结果却在关键的地方咬到了舌头。看来，脱口秀对我来说还为时尚早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2d30f59d8a2bfd66031deb43943a87cc914346a7f8664ee1a1b42cdd449c4fa9", "ja": "はは、そっちは追々頑張ればいいよ。とにかく、\nこれからも瑞希の笑顔で、みんなを元気にしてくれ。", "zh": "哈哈，那方面以后再慢慢努力就好。总之，\n\n今后也要用瑞希的笑容，让大家打起精神来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0243_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "ce2b26b150db682d496a5922dcb131108b5cddd9a4be18a3e7278149a9dc0eb0", "ja": "はい。さしあたって、{$P$}を\n元気にしたいと思います……にっこり。", "zh": "好的。目前，我想先让{$P$}打起精神来……微笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
